This package is a PHP port of pi-antigravity
(https://github.com/Rahularya01/pi-antigravity), Copyright (c) 2026 Rahul Arya,
MIT License: the model discovery and grouping, the request loop and its error
wording, the account store, quota, image generation and Google Search grounding
follow that project file by file, and are kept in step with its releases.

The streaming, the Gemini request shapes and the OAuth plumbing are pig's own
(https://github.com/owner888/pig), MIT License.

The web page reader (src/WebFetch) follows pi-antigravity's web-fetch. Where that
uses libraries, this package carries its own PHP for what they do, written
against their behaviour:
  - Turndown (https://github.com/mixmark-io/turndown), Copyright (c) 2017 Dom
    Christie, MIT License, with its collapse-whitespace (Copyright (c) 2014
    Luc Thevenard, MIT License);
  - turndown-plugin-gfm (https://github.com/mixmark-io/turndown-plugin-gfm),
    Copyright (c) 2017 Dom Christie, MIT License.

tests/fixtures/web-fetch holds pi-antigravity's saved copies of public web
pages, used only to test the reader; each page belongs to its publisher.
